Description: Find and remove unnecessary development folders
 Pro Space Optimizer is a modern Liquid Glass desktop utility that
 recursively scans parent folders you choose for disposable development
 folders such as node_modules, vendor, .venv, __pycache__, build and
 dist.
 .
 It supports project-aware ecosystem detection (160+ ecosystems), a
 detected-ecosystem column, move-to-Trash by default, permanent deletion
 with confirmation, optional administrator retry for permission errors,
 and a name-only fallback mode.
 .
 This package is self-contained: it bundles its own Python interpreter
 and PySide6/Qt, so no additional setup is required on the target system.
